// shader-differential uniform-application control, baked half.
//
// The literal here MUST match the u1 set value the stager writes to
// uniforms.txt for sd_uniform_ctrl's u_color — the pair's identity
// is the proof that uniform application works.  Values chosen to be
// exactly representable in 8-bit channels (0.75*255=191.25 -> both
// sides round identically whatever the packer convention, because
// both sides go through the SAME packer).
void main(out float4 color : COLOR)
{
    color = float4(0.75f, 0.25f, 0.5f, 1.0f);
}
